+/// Whether the phone's own table says the data partition is encrypted
+/// whole. A phone whose table names no `metadata_encryption=` for it keeps
+/// the filesystem bare on the partition, as some vendor builds of this
+/// generation do, and it is mounted as it lies. This is asked of the
+/// table alone, so that nothing reads `/data/unencrypted` before the
